@baseUrl = http://localhost:5018
@networkCategoryId = 2

### List all tickets by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets

### Search titles and descriptions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?search=VPN

### Filter to tickets in progress
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?status=In%20Progress

### Find open network tickets that mention VPN, newest first
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?search=VPN&status=Open&categoryId={{networkCategoryId}}&sort=newest

### Sort ticket titles alphabetically
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?sort=title

### Verify an unsupported sort returns 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?sort=unknown
